# Loaded only when Mythic Adventures is also selected (see _celmae.pcc).
# ParangonMythicTier is raised by the class at levels 4, 14 and 20; Mythic Level Tracker
# turns it into real mythic tiers, which grant Hard to Kill, Mythic Power, Surge (tier 1),
# Amazing Initiative (tier 2) and Recuperation (tier 3) on their own.
# The book forces the Champion path and hands out Fleet Charge, Always a Chance, Precision
# and Extra Mythic Power, so the matching selection pools are reduced by as much.

# Draconic Hatred has no Mythic Adventures equivalent: it is specific to this book.
Parangon ~ Draconic Hatred	KEY:Parangon ~ Draconic Hatred	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Parangon Class Feature.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	DESC:As a free action, the Parangon may expend one use of mythic power to increase every Dragon Enemy bonus by 2 for 1 minute. For the rest of that turn his attacks against dragons bypass all damage reduction.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

